    <data key="d0">Bristol Myers Squibb - Standardized Application Stack Assembly using AWS Service Catalog</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ameanoaMldM</data>
    <data key="d2">Bristol Myers Squibb abstracts application components (S3, CloudFront, Lambda, API Gateway, ACM, Route 53) into reusable AWS Service Catalog products. CloudFormation assembles these products into full project solutions, which CodePipeline then deploys across Dev, Test, and Production environments, reducing deployment times from weeks to 15 minutes.</data>
    <data key="d3">DevOps, Governance, Serverless</data>
    <data key="d4">True</data>
